    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock full face tracking on your avatars with VRCFT (VRChat Face Tracking)--a powerful, modular desktop application that unleashes face-tracking support from multiple VR headsets and trackers. Simply install VRCFT, choose the module(s) that apply to your hardware, and use a Unified Expression enabled avatar in VRChat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrates seamlessly with VRChat using OSC</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduced the Unified Expression standard (142 supported blendshapes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works with a wide variety of free, paid, and custom avatars </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works with the Quest Pro, Vive Pro Eye, Vive Facial Tracker, and other popular hardware</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy setup and light footprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VRCFT is the go-to standard for adding face tracking to VRChat.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock full face tracking on your avatars with VRCFT (VRChat Face Tracking)--a powerful, modular desktop application that unleashes face-tracking support from multiple VR headsets and trackers. Simply install VRCFT, choose the module(s) that apply to your hardware, and use a Unified Expression enabled avatar in VRChat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrates seamlessly with VRChat using OSC</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduced the Unified Expression standard (142 supported blendshapes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works with a wide variety of free, paid, and custom avatars </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works with the Quest Pro, Vive Pro Eye, Vive Facial Tracker, and other popular hardware</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy setup and light footprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VRCFT is the go-to standard for adding face tracking to VRChat.</p>",
    "short_description": "VRCFaceTracking creates a bridge between facial-tracking hardware, and applications compliant with the Open Sound Control protocol",
